# Diagnostic, not a receipt: the step budget against the page's own frames,
# the speed lane's frame-budget before/after comparison (physics catalog plan,
# 2026-10-04, "The display's frame"). Run with
# ?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=50 or =max; the pace
# lines in the receipt carry the budget and the intervals it was taken from.
assert snap ready == true
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
settle 90
log-physics diag
log diag speed budget complete
